WEBVTT

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.160
Polar Bear's Café

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:20.450
Polar Bear's Café

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:34.990
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:34.240
Panda's Apprenticeship.

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:37.910
Mr. Penguin.

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:39.240
What is it?

00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:42.370
What's your daily routine like?

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:46.330
Come to think of it, 
you're always at the café.

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:50.500
Now, now. Everyone has a shady side.

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:53.840
Hey! Don't summarize it in a way
 that makes me look bad!

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:58.770
I do a lot when I'm not at the café.

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:02.020
I take walks, go home,

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:05.550
tweet, and stand on street corners.

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:07.900
Apparently you don't know what 
to do with your free time.

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:09.510
I do know what to do!

00:02:09.510 --> 00:02:11.520
I'm using my time wisely!

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:14.020
Heyo.

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:16.940
Here are the beans.

00:02:17.310 --> 00:02:18.540
Thanks for your hard work.

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:20.070
Have you gotten used to your job?

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:21.220
Somewhat.

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:27.150
Would you like a parfait?

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:28.870
Would I?!

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:31.170
And a coffee! Black, please!

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:34.820
Oh, wait.

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:37.000
He was going to show me 
how to roast after this.

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:39.630
I'll be back later for the parfait.

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:42.500
Wait for me, master!

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:48.000
He seems to be doing well 
with Mr. Tree Kangaroo.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.310
Indeed.

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:51.240
That must be nice.

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:54.960
I want to be someone's 
apprentice, too.

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:56.330
What brought this on?

00:02:56.900 --> 00:03:00.630
I got a little envious watching that guy.

00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:02.560
Oh, you mean Masaki?

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:04.120
That guy?

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:05.990
You're the one who taught him

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:07.340
how delicious coffee is.

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:08.750
Let's remember that.

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:13.710
More importantly, you can be 
my apprentice if you want.

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:15.250
No thanks.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.910
That was fast.

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:20.920
Hey, Miss Sasako, 
make me your apprentice.

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:24.390
Are you okay with anyone, Panda?

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:27.510
I'm not okay with anyone.

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:29.230
Only the people I see.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:32.070
That would mean anyone...

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.360
What does that make me?

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.040
Panda.

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:37.360
What?

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:40.660
Why don't you want to be 
Mr. Penguin's apprentice?

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:43.820
Hold up. I don't think 
we have to go there.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:47.790
Hello!

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.410
Hello, Mr. Anteater.

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:53.110
Please make me your apprentice.

00:03:53.110 --> 00:03:53.950
Huh?

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.910
I won't do absolutely anything, but

00:03:56.910 --> 00:03:58.170
please make me your apprentice.

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:01.930
I've heard of, "I'll do 
anything, so please make me

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:03.440
your apprentice," but...

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:06.140
Apparently he won't do absolutely anything...

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:08.150
Sure, I'll make you my apprentice!

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:10.540
Yay!

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:11.780
Just like that...

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:15.500
Master! Please show me your ways!

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:18.150
Here we go. 
This is the intimidation pose.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.380
Okay. Now you try.

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:24.990
Like this?

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:30.550
Good! All right, break time.

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:31.300
Okay.

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:33.740
All right, we're going to eat now.

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:35.640
Yay, food.

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:38.980
I eat 30,000 ants in a single day.

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:41.570
Come on. Let's eat together!

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:44.930
One! Two! Three!

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:48.870
Only 29,997 more!

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:49.820
Okay!

00:04:49.820 --> 00:04:50.680
Huh?

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:53.850
You quit already?

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:55.920
Something wasn't right.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:57.350
You dropped out way too fast.

00:04:57.930 --> 00:04:59.360
I've made up my mind!

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:02.730
I'm going to be the 
apprentice of the next person

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:04.280
who comes through that door.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:07.790
That's definitely a unique 
way of doing it.

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:20.980
Hello.

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:22.790
Pass.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:24.920
You can pass?!

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:28.760
I see. So you're looking for a master.

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:30.740
Next.

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:32.810
I'll be the apprentice 
of the next person.

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:36.770
Do you actually intend to 
become an apprentice?

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:39.690
Hello.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:41.330
Go home!

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:43.580
Huh? What the heck?

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:46.060
Well, I'll come again.

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:50.880
Could you not chase away customers?

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:54.480
The master I'm looking 
for is different.

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:55.470
Panda.

00:05:57.110 --> 00:06:01.500
The person you're searching for 
might be closer than you think.

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:03.960
Oh!

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:09.930
Well, my mom isn't so much 
a master as just a mom.

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:12.810
I guess if it comes down to it,

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:16.410
I'll have to settle on being 
Mr. Penguin's apprentice.

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:18.730
Would it be okay to decline that?

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:21.900
What about Mr. Polar Bear, Panda?

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:24.490
Yeah.

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:27.010
He could teach you how 
to properly prepare coffee,

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:32.020
Yes, yes, yes.

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:28.820
how to surf, and other things.

00:06:29.230 --> 00:06:30.640
Not to mention the puns.

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:36.480
None of those things interest me.

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:40.010
I see...

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:43.290
Did that get you down?

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:48.890
I don't want to learn or 
train for something.

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:53.260
I just want to lazily 
be an apprentice.

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:55.860
Why don't you give up on 
being an apprentice?

00:06:56.980 --> 00:06:57.980
Ding!

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:01.310
What is it, Polar Bear?

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:04.020
I know of the perfect person, Panda.

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:05.480
Really? Who?

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:08.940
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:15.780
Sloth...

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:19.340
You'll be able to lazily 
be an apprentice.

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:20.780
That's true.

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:25.030
Excuse me, do you work at all?

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:31.680
I'm always... lazing around...

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:34.450
Always lazing around?

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:40.110
Master! Please make 
me your apprentice!

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:42.600
Gladly.

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:48.480
I wonder how Panda's getting along.

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:52.820
Huh?

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:56.330
Polar Bear, did you change the 
flavor of the café mocha?

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:59.500
I'm sorry! I made a mistake.

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:02.420
What mistake?

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:03.420
Oh, it's nothing...

00:08:05.770 --> 00:08:07.920
What's wrong with Miss Sasako?

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.380
I wonder.

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:15.260
Excuse me, could I place my order?

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:16.520
Oh, yes!

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:18.680
I'm curious.

00:08:26.390 --> 00:08:27.520
Master?

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:30.950
What?

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:34.830
How long am I supposed to laze around?

00:08:35.670 --> 00:08:38.670
For...ev...er...

00:08:39.210 --> 00:08:41.000
How long is forever?

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:44.960
It's... forever...

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:50.060
In terms of time, how much longer?

00:08:50.620 --> 00:08:55.910
Usually... about 19 hours...

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:58.430
19 hours?

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:04.530
I moved... a little bit earlier...

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:08.400
So for about another 17 hours...

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:14.740
Master.

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:18.100
Yes?

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:19.620
What about food?

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.450
On top of the tree...

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:22.960
On top of the tree?

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:30.790
Yep... just like this... 
and there are leaves...

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:33.150
Anything else?

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:35.260
Do we do anything else?

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:40.470
Nope... we just... 
stay like this forever...

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:43.980
Forever?

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:47.080
Anything else?

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:49.400
Do we do anything else?

00:09:50.010 --> 00:09:55.360
Once a week... we go on land...

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:57.880
Once a week?

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:00.330
We only go on land once a week?

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:03.200
We don't have to...

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:04.240
I want to!

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:08.010
I went down on Tuesday...

00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:12.880
So I'll be up here for 
about five days...

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:18.970
Master, what about the bathroom?

00:10:19.230 --> 00:10:20.930
On Tuesday...

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:25.450
You only go to the bathroom 
once a week, too?

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:30.900
Yep. Otherwise... 
I'm always up here...

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:33.860
Always?

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:41.260
Lazing around sure is difficult...

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:45.240
Such amazing laziness.

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:48.290
I can't copy it!

00:10:50.840 --> 00:10:52.050
He's a pro.

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:55.090
He's a pro in laziness!

00:10:58.910 --> 00:11:01.720
So, you quit being his apprentice?

00:11:02.110 --> 00:11:05.420
Yeah. I gave up trying to be a pro in laziness.

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:06.510
I see.

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:08.730
I've made up my mind.

00:11:09.150 --> 00:11:10.330
About what?

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:12.690
I don't need a master.

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:16.310
I'm going to be an 
amateur in laziness.

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:19.650
That is a ridiculously 
undisciplined phrase.

00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:24.460
I'm going to be lazy at my own pace.

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:26.760
Has there ever been more 
of a decision

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:28.410
that didn't need to be declared?

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:33.390
Huh? This is the usual café mocha.

00:11:33.780 --> 00:11:35.770
I quit, as well.

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:42.020
What are you talking 
about, Miss Sasako?

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:43.510
Now, now.

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:47.500
Everyone has their secrets.

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:49.740
Just like you, Mr. Penguin.

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:53.040
Could you not say it 
like that, Polar Bear?

00:11:53.480 --> 00:12:00.940
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:05.870
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:05.150
A Sports Day Filled With Animals!

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:11.010
Good morning!

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:15.950
What are you doing, Mr. Polar Bear?

00:12:15.950 --> 00:12:18.690
Oh, Miss Sasako, you're late.

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:21.760
Huh? What's going on?

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:23.680
Let's go.

00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:27.130
Huh? I just got here.

00:12:27.130 --> 00:12:28.680
What's going on?

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:30.660
Hurry, hurry.

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:32.130
Where are we going?

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:33.640
Don't worry about it. Let's go.

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:36.610
Admission Gate

00:12:37.030 --> 00:12:39.070
And now, we will begin

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:42.480
the neighborhood sports day.

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:55.320
Um... I'm going to be hosting this?

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:57.050
There's nothing to worry about.

00:12:57.050 --> 00:12:58.570
That's not what I meant.

00:12:58.570 --> 00:13:01.880
I'm more wondering why I'm 
the host of a sports day.

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:05.400
I was in charge of 
operations this year.

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:07.180
I did it last year.

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:11.810
I might not like speaking 
in front of people.

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:15.350
I don't really know what's 
going on, but all right.

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:16.980
Thanks.

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:21.980
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:27.450
Um... we will now commence this 
year's neighborhood sports day.

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:30.390
Is everyone listening?!

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:30.390
Wake up, Panda!

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:32.360
Hey, Polar Bear!

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:34.540
You're going down this year!

00:13:36.640 --> 00:13:38.710
Get fired up, get fired up!

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:40.000
Well, he's on fire.

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:43.170
Busy, busy.

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:44.400
Panda Mama.

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:45.720
Oh, hello there, Mama Red Squirrel.

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:50.430
I'm sorry, I lost track of time 
helping out the husband.

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:51.960
No worries.

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:53.940
It's going to be a busy day today.

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:55.490
Come on now.

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:57.540
Don't just put bamboo 
grass in the rice balls.

00:13:57.540 --> 00:13:58.690
Make sure you get 
walnuts in some, too.

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:01.690
Good idea. I'll add some walnuts, too.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:05.260
So you're going to put it in 
with the bamboo grass...

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:08.410
I wonder if that's going to be okay...

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:10.600
Fired up, fired up!

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:13.060
Yeah, fired up!

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:18.300
Am I the only human participant?

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:19.880
Um...

00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:22.760
Thank you for always looking 
after my brother.

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:25.590
Oh, Panda's little sister.

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:26.450
Hello.

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:29.490
I'm always cheering for 
your zookeeper skills.

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:31.010
Oh, thank you.

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:34.970
How exactly do you feed everyone?

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:37.690
Well, with Mr. Llama, 
something like this.

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:41.150
Wow, so cool!

00:14:42.140 --> 00:14:44.190
Good luck with the sports day!

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:47.820
Oh, I'm so embarrassed! So cool!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:50.260
Everyone participating 
in the first event,

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:51.490
please gather around.

00:14:54.090 --> 00:14:56.450
Everyone, please listen!

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:58.730
Oh, it's starting.

00:14:58.730 --> 00:14:59.420
Let's do our best.

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:03.240
You're stabbing me! 
You're stabbing me!

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:04.460
Oh, sorry.

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:11.850
We will now begin the foot race.

00:15:13.590 --> 00:15:15.090
Ready...

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:20.940
Why am I participating again?

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:32.320
My Prince! You can do it!

00:15:34.590 --> 00:15:40.210
One, two... One, two...

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:46.440
Here we go... Here we go...

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:52.030
I'm not going to lose...

00:15:50.070 --> 00:15:52.840
Me, neither...

00:15:55.110 --> 00:15:57.300
First place: Mr. Handa.

00:15:57.300 --> 00:15:59.810
Second place: Mr. Lesser Panda.

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:03.270
So cool!

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:06.050
Congratulations, Mr. Handa!

00:16:06.050 --> 00:16:08.770
Why not shoot for the Olympics?

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:10.570
I wasn't that great...

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:13.460
I've lost, Mr. Handa.

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:18.280
Please live the rest of 
your life with pride,

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:20.520
as the man who defeated 
 a lesser panda.

00:16:20.970 --> 00:16:23.040
Somehow, I'm not that happy.

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:27.140
There you go again, 
putting in all that bamboo grass.

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:30.810
Oh, but the bamboo grass is so 
delicious, Mama Red Squirrel.

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:32.510
Let's make normal ones, too.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:36.520
The next event is the 
seal eating contest.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:40.890
One, two, three, four...

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:41.250
In lane one is Mr. Polar Bear.

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:44.350
Two, two, three, four...

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:47.570
It appears that Mr. Polar Bear 
is the only participant.

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:48.770
We'll have to cancel.

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:50.440
This isn't an event to 
do in the neighborhood.

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:53.610
Let's do it, Mr. Handa! Let's do it!

00:16:54.100 --> 00:16:56.780
I can't eat seals!

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:00.540
Mr. Handa!

00:17:00.860 --> 00:17:01.710
Yes?

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:03.350
Let's have an ant eating contest!

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:06.460
Ready, start!

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:10.500
Let's see... Ants, ants, ants...

00:17:08.100 --> 00:17:10.500
I can't eat ants, either...

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:33.400
Polar Bear's Café

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:40.370
Neighborhood Sports Day

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:40.370
Foot Race
Seal Eating Contest (Canceled)
Ant Eating Contest (Canceled)
Hurdle Race
Obstacle Race
Bread Eating Contest
Lunch Break
Scavenger Hunt
Three-Legged Race

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:37.510
The next event is the 
scavenger hunt.

00:17:37.510 --> 00:17:40.370
Everyone participating, 
please gather around.

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:44.960
Is everyone ready?

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:48.750
It's finally feeling 
like a sports day.

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:54.260
Do your best, Mr. Penguin!

00:17:55.730 --> 00:17:57.720
Th-The Penkos?!

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:01.030
"It's usually annoying,

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:03.510
but at times like this, it's nice 
to hear their high-pitched cheering."

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:05.440
Was that what you were thinking?

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:08.650
Could you not explain 
how I'm feeling?

00:18:09.450 --> 00:18:10.520
Ready?

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:21.560
Let's see.

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:23.220
Which one should I grab?

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:24.040
Let's see...

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:29.420
I guess it's not high class 
to eat high class paper.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.090
Jeez!

00:18:31.090 --> 00:18:33.340
This guy doesn't understand 
this event at all!

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:35.510
All right, this one!

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:39.890
Penjolina

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:47.270
Uh... W-What the...

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:53.270
Um... um... um...

00:18:51.320 --> 00:18:53.270
What's wrong, Mr. Penguin?

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:55.600
Penjolina...

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:57.520
Penjolina...

00:18:57.520 --> 00:18:59.240
Penjolina...

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:03.700
Miss Penjolina!

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:06.180
I'm Penko!

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:07.360
Sorry.

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:08.850
Miss Penjolina!

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:10.130
I'm Penna!

00:19:10.130 --> 00:19:11.220
I'm sorry!

00:19:11.220 --> 00:19:12.120
Miss Penjolina!

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:13.090
I'm Penuelle!

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:13.920
I'm sorry...

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:16.100
Goal!

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:18.840
Haniwa

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:18.840
First Place: Mr. Llama!

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:21.350
It's a Haniwa statue.

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:22.850
Good job finding it.

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:26.520
We will now

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:29.350
begin our final event.

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:32.060
The three-legged race!

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:34.870
Let's do our best.

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:38.530
This is really unbalanced.

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:39.810
You think so?

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:42.600
Exactly how did we get 
paired together?

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:43.990
Well, it's the luck of the draw.

00:19:44.440 --> 00:19:45.970
Hey, Polar Bear.

00:19:46.590 --> 00:19:48.480
What is it, Grizzly?

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:51.440
You're going down! 
I'm not giving you first place!

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:53.210
Panda! We're gonna give 
it all we've got!

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:56.820
Okay. I'll give it all 
I got and go slowly.

00:19:56.820 --> 00:19:58.900
Don't go slowly!

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:02.630
Well, then. Ready...

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:10.880
We're... unbalanced!

00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:15.900
Hey! What the hell are you doing?!

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:19.440
Mr. Grizzly! Let's rest 
first before we go!

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:21.880
You idiot! Hurry the hell up!

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:23.920
We're going to lose to Polar Bear!

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:25.500
Enough!

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:45.260
First place: the Lesser 
Panda and Badger team!

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:46.520
Damn it!

00:20:46.520 --> 00:20:49.250
We won! We totally won! Yay!

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:52.430
Everyone! Please give us 
a round of applause!

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:52.430
Thank you! Thank you!

00:20:52.860 --> 00:20:58.720
One, two... One, two...

00:20:59.090 --> 00:21:02.030
Here we go...

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:04.380
One, two...

00:21:02.710 --> 00:21:04.380
Here we go...

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:08.030
Apparently the foot 
race is still going.

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:14.000
You're a worthy opponent... Sloth...

00:21:14.300 --> 00:21:19.880
As are you... Mr. Tortoise...

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:26.520
Goal...

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:48.280
Thanks for all your hard work.

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:51.150
I'm so tired.

00:21:51.150 --> 00:21:54.250
You're probably the most exhausted.

00:21:55.260 --> 00:21:56.830
I'm beat.

00:21:56.830 --> 00:21:58.090
Thanks for all your hard work.

00:21:58.090 --> 00:21:59.710
Thanks for your hard 
work, Miss Sasako.

00:22:02.580 --> 00:22:05.020
You were a great host, Miss Sasako!

00:22:05.020 --> 00:22:08.000
My little brother is 
getting married,

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:09.330
so could you host that, too?

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:09.970
Huh?

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:11.730
Yep. She can.

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:14.310
I will not.

00:22:14.310 --> 00:22:24.820
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:23:54.890 --> 00:24:24.480
Next Time

00:23:58.030 --> 00:23:59.660
Mr. Penguin, Mr. Penguin.

00:23:59.660 --> 00:24:00.870
What is it, Panda?

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.270
They say it's okay to make
 a fool of yourself on vacation,

00:24:03.270 --> 00:24:04.920
so could you make a fool of yourself?

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:06.300
I'd rather not.

00:24:06.300 --> 00:24:08.490
Then could you jump into 
the Doutonbori River?

00:24:08.490 --> 00:24:09.920
I'd rather not.

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:12.320
You're so conservative, Mr. Penguin.

00:24:12.320 --> 00:24:15.110
I've always wanted to have a real
conversation with you just once...

00:24:15.110 --> 00:24:16.500
Let's end this, Polar Bear.

00:24:16.500 --> 00:24:17.260
Hey!

00:24:17.260 --> 00:24:19.090
Next week's Polar Bear's Café,

00:24:19.090 --> 00:24:20.640
will be brought to you by radio only.

00:24:20.640 --> 00:24:22.470
It'll be brought to 
you by television only.

00:24:21.410 --> 00:24:24.000
Mr. Penguin's Hobbies
Their Childhood Days.

00:24:22.470 --> 00:24:24.000
Enjoy!
